    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/f030b1173eb845f4d897497f97302c9c.poster.avif?t=1738663377\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/f030b1173eb845f4d897497f97302c9c.webm?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/f030b1173eb845f4d897497f97302c9c.mp4?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TL;DR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lots of video game themed ships to pilot<br></li><li>Retro invader action!<br></li><li>Chain powerups to become an unstoppable machine of invader destruction<br></li><li>Simple single-stick (or mouse) auto-shoot controls that even your Grandma could use<br></li><li>Win new ships inside boxes of delicious sugar coated Astro Puffs!<br></li><li>Be publicly humiliated by your Grandma on the global leaderboard<br></li><li>Bullets fire and enemies move to the beat. Watch out as we up the tempo!<br></li><li>Complete missions to earn even more coins!<br></li><li>Heaps of achievements to unlock!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><br><strong>Combine Powerups</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/3ec25fc73266e912e62eb05eca1a9759.poster.avif?t=1738663377\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/3ec25fc73266e912e62eb05eca1a9759.webm?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/3ec25fc73266e912e62eb05eca1a9759.mp4?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Stack multiple powerups at once to become an unstoppable force of intergalactic vengeance. Rapid fire? What about if you rapid fire giant bullets? Rapid fire giant bullets in THREE DIRECTIONS!<br><br><strong>Single Stick Shooter</strong><br>Play the whole game single handed with our single-stick controls! No need to hold down that fire button, we do it for you! Why would you want to not shoot? Are you a coward? PEW PEW PEW!<br><br><strong>Move to the Beat</strong><br>Shoot and move to the beat with a dynamic retro synthwave soundtrack that increases the tempo the longer you last! You think that fat beat is chill? Well, let's see how you go at 180bpm!<br><br><strong>Classic Score Attack Gameplay</strong><br>Like the arcade games of old, keep playing as long as you can before your eventual demise. Score points, compete on the global leaderboards. Challenge your friends!<br><br><strong>Smash Enemies</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/e178160d0c0a68d64642bb903269c1b8.poster.avif?t=1738663377\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/e178160d0c0a68d64642bb903269c1b8.webm?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/e178160d0c0a68d64642bb903269c1b8.mp4?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Shot and destroyed an invader? Shoot and rebound that floating wreckage directly into another one!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPLAYABILITY</h2><br><strong>Unlock Retro Ships</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/1cf5c543d42bc979a3bca8b29cc2cd6e.poster.avif?t=1738663377\" width=608 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/1cf5c543d42bc979a3bca8b29cc2cd6e.webm?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/1cf5c543d42bc979a3bca8b29cc2cd6e.mp4?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Over 80 unique ships to unlock, with heaps of unique themes inspired by decades of gaming and geek culture! Collect coins and complete missions to buy your favorite new ship, or maybe open a sugary packet of Astro Puffs and see what's inside!<br><br><strong>Missions</strong><br>Complete missions with unique challenges to earn extra coins to spend on ships and delicious Astro Puffs.<br><br><strong>Secrets!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/a76680955230c4aecb2cef2f956704df.poster.avif?t=1738663377\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/a76680955230c4aecb2cef2f956704df.webm?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/a76680955230c4aecb2cef2f956704df.mp4?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Discover secret ships, and maybe even a super hidden game mode. Well, not that hidden. I'm mentioning it now. I'm not very good at this.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/f030b1173eb845f4d897497f97302c9c.poster.avif?t=1738663377\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/f030b1173eb845f4d897497f97302c9c.webm?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/f030b1173eb845f4d897497f97302c9c.mp4?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TL;DR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lots of video game themed ships to pilot<br></li><li>Retro invader action!<br></li><li>Chain powerups to become an unstoppable machine of invader destruction<br></li><li>Simple single-stick (or mouse) auto-shoot controls that even your Grandma could use<br></li><li>Win new ships inside boxes of delicious sugar coated Astro Puffs!<br></li><li>Be publicly humiliated by your Grandma on the global leaderboard<br></li><li>Bullets fire and enemies move to the beat. Watch out as we up the tempo!<br></li><li>Complete missions to earn even more coins!<br></li><li>Heaps of achievements to unlock!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><br><strong>Combine Powerups</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/3ec25fc73266e912e62eb05eca1a9759.poster.avif?t=1738663377\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/3ec25fc73266e912e62eb05eca1a9759.webm?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/3ec25fc73266e912e62eb05eca1a9759.mp4?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>