 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/1cf5c543d42bc979a3bca8b29cc2cd6e.webm?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/1cf5c543d42bc979a3bca8b29cc2cd6e.mp4?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Over 80 unique ships to unlock, with heaps of unique themes inspired by decades of gaming and geek culture! Collect coins and complete missions to buy your favorite new ship, or maybe open a sugary packet of Astro Puffs and see what's inside!<br><br><strong>Missions</strong><br>Complete missions with unique challenges to earn extra coins to spend on ships and delicious Astro Puffs.<br><br><strong>Secrets!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/a76680955230c4aecb2cef2f956704df.poster.avif?t=1738663377\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/a76680955230c4aecb2cef2f956704df.webm?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939460/extras/a76680955230c4aecb2cef2f956704df.mp4?t=1738663377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Discover secret ships, and maybe even a super hidden game mode. Well, not that hidden. I'm mentioning it now. I'm not very good at this.",
